{"seq":6,"slug":"marketing","title":"市场营销","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/marketing","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"市场营销\">市场营销</h1><p>我最早对市场营销产生兴趣，是因为发现身边那些&quot;卖得好&quot;的东西，往往并不是质量最好的那一个。一杯普通的奶茶能排两小时队，一双成本几十块的鞋能卖上千元，这背后到底发生了什么？带着这个疑问，我开始把市场营销当成一门可以自学的学科来啃，而不是看成&quot;做广告&quot;或者&quot;忽悠人&quot;的代名词。</p>\n<p>学下来我才慢慢明白，营销真正研究的是一件朴素的事：人为什么会想要某样东西，又为什么愿意为它掏钱。它既有像消费者心理这样偏感性的部分，也有像市场调研、定价模型这样需要数据支撑的硬核内容。两者缺一不可——光懂人心而不会算账，做不出可持续的生意；只盯着报表而不理解人，又会把产品做得冰冷。</p>\n<p>这个学习路径我按四个台阶来安排，目的是让一个完全没有商科背景的人也能拾级而上。</p>\n<p>第一阶段先把地基打牢：营销到底是什么、价值交换的本质，以及消费者从产生需求到最终下单中间经历了哪些心理环节。</p>\n<p>第二阶段进入&quot;做决策&quot;的层面：如何通过市场调研去了解真实需求，再用 STP（细分、目标、定位）这套被全球企业反复验证的框架，回答&quot;我到底要服务谁、在他们心里占据什么位置&quot;。</p>\n<p>第三阶段是营销最经典的工具箱——4P（产品、价格、渠道、促销）。我会重点讲清楚品牌如何为产品加分、定价背后的多种逻辑，以及货怎么铺、声怎么传。</p>\n<p>第四阶段对接当下：2026 年的营销早已离不开数字渠道、社交媒体和内容创作。生成式搜索、社交电商、UGC 与达人合作正在重写规则，我会把这些新趋势和前面的经典理论串起来。</p>\n<p>需要提醒的是，本学科里有大量&quot;看起来很对但其实要分情况&quot;的结论。我在写每一节时都会尽量给出可以亲自验证的小练习，鼓励你拿身边真实的品牌去对照思考，而不是死记术语。营销不是背出来的，是观察和试错试出来的。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"marketing-principles-consumer-behavior","title":"营销原理与消费者行为","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/marketing/marketing-principles-consumer-behavior","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-marketing","title":"市场营销到底是什么","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/marketing/marketing-principles-consumer-behavior/what-is-marketing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"needs-wants-value-exchange","title":"需要、欲望与价值交换","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/marketing/marketing-principles-consumer-behavior/needs-wants-value-exchange"},{"seq":3,"slug":"consumer-decision-process","title":"消费者决策过程","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/marketing/marketing-principles-consumer-behavior/consumer-decision-process"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"market-research-stp","title":"市场调研与STP战略","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/marketing/market-research-stp","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"market-research-methods","title":"市场调研方法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/marketing/market-research-stp/market-research-methods"},{"seq":2,"slug":"market-segmentation-targeting","title":"市场细分与目标选择","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/marketing/market-research-stp/market-segmentation-targeting"},{"seq":3,"slug":"positioning-strategy","title":"定位战略","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/marketing/market-research-stp/positioning-strategy"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"marketing-mix-4p","title":"营销组合4P","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/marketing/marketing-mix-4p","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"product-and-branding","title":"产品与品牌","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/marketing/marketing-mix-4p/product-and-branding"},{"seq":2,"slug":"pricing-strategies","title":"定价策略","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/marketing/marketing-mix-4p/pricing-strategies"},{"seq":3,"slug":"place-and-promotion","title":"渠道与促销","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/marketing/marketing-mix-4p/place-and-promotion"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"digital-marketing-brand","title":"数字营销与品牌建设","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/marketing/digital-marketing-brand","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"digital-marketing-channels","title":"数字营销渠道","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/marketing/digital-marketing-brand/digital-marketing-channels"},{"seq":2,"slug":"social-media-and-content","title":"社交媒体与内容营销","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/marketing/digital-marketing-brand/social-media-and-content"},{"seq":3,"slug":"brand-building-and-loyalty","title":"品牌建设与顾客忠诚","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/marketing/digital-marketing-brand/brand-building-and-loyalty"}]}]}